{"id":"meca_nica","lemma":"mecánica","pos":"noun","rank":4908,"glosses":["mechanics","machinery"],"ipa":"/meˈkanika/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mecánicas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mec%C3%A1nica.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ten cuidado con las escaleras mecánicas.","en":"Be careful on escalators.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505255","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"care (close attention"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"stairs","l":"escalera"},null]},{"text":"La escalera mecánica me agarró un cordón del zapato.","en":"My shoelace got caught in the escalator.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"stairs"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to grab or take hold of","l":"agarrar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"shoelace"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"shoe"}]},{"text":"Todo el mundo usa las escaleras mecánicas.","en":"Everyone uses escalators.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505259","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to use","l":"usar"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"stairs","l":"escalera"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"everyone, everybody"]]}]}